The JSON files in this folder are MCA Selector's name registries (src/main/resources/mapping/registry/
at commit 8a0bcbfc63617e2e02fdb85a1656251550f6c074), minified, used to validate filter values as
MCA Selector does; biome_name_to_id.json is stored as [name, id] pairs in the original order.
https://github.com/Querz/mcaselector

